On session start, refresh bounded context with:
`lwm hub bridge '{"phase": "context", "tool": "cursor", "project_path": "/Users/ethan/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Downloads/LLM-WorkMem/projects/antigravity"}' --output markdown --root '/Users/ethan/Library/Application Support/llm-workmem-runtime/llm-workmem'`

